<h2>Start with what you have</h2>

<p>You do not need to rebuild everything overnight. Start with the highest-impact change: get a booking calendar on your website and in your Google listing. That alone will capture leads you are currently losing.</p>

<p>Then add the reminders. Then connect it to your CRM. Then build the follow-up. Each layer compounds on the last. Within a week, you will have a system that books, confirms, reminds, and follows up without you being involved in any of it.</p>

<p>The leads are already looking for you. The question is whether you make it easy enough for them to say yes.</p>

